data: {"id": "5c0b97f219454131-thinking-parallel_evidence-1331", "run_id": "5c0b97f219454131", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已拿到全部首轮结果，现在整理证据并给出结论。\n\n## 采集到的事实\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期与 Prometheus Metrics\n- `kube_pod_status_phase` 指标确认当前 phase = **Pending** (value=1)，Running/Succeeded/Failed/Unknown 均为 0。\n- 无 `waiting_reason`、`last_terminated_reason`、`restarts_total` 匹配数据（说明容器从未启动）。\n\n### 2. kubectl describe — 调度事件\n- **Node: `<none>`** — Pod 未被调度到任何节点。\n- **Events（两条，重复发生）：**\n  - `Warning FailedScheduling 57m default-scheduler 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.`\n  - `Warning FailedSched", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789039051471, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

